      "message": "Also note that back in 2020 we considered possible that \"someone\" may register an agent with a null interface, as per your comment in https://android-review.git.corp.google.com/c/platform/frameworks/base/+/1501816/31/services/core/java/com/android/server/ConnectivityService.java l.4781",
